<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber ups Esterline.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber ups Esterline.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber Jack Modzelewski upgraded Esterline Technologies Corp, a diversified electronics maker, to buy from attractive, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst bumped up his estimate for Esterline's fiscal year ending October 1997 to $2.70 from $2.60 per share, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/4 to 24-1/4 in Monday morning trading.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
